      ALSA: hda: Add ASRock N68C-S UCC the power_save blacklist

Hui Wang (2):
      ALSA: hda/realtek - fix the pop noise on headphone for lenovo laptops
      ALSA: usb-audio: Add vendor and product name for Dell WD19 Dock

